            <ArticleTitle>The treatment of chronic benign pain syndrome in capitated health care.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>77-83</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Developing specialized services for the management of chronic benign pain syndrome offers enhanced patient care and reduced costs. The evolution of a behavioral medicine/health psychology department to provide these services in a large HMO is described. Operational aspects and implementation challenges are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
